  "description": "A More Confident Start to Electric Dirt Bike Riding\nDesigned for young riders to progress step by step, the HT100 combines three selectable speed levels, smooth throttle response, front and rear disc brakes, dual suspension and 14-inch pneumatic tyres. Riders can begin at 10 km/h and move up as their skills and confidence develop.\nThree Speed Levels for Step-by-Step Progression\nStart at 10 km/h while the rider gets familiar with balance, braking and throttle control, then move to 15 km/h or 25 km/h as skills and confidence improve. Three selectable speed levels make it easier to choose a pace suited to the rider’s experience and riding environment. Adult supervision is recommended.\nSmooth & Comfortable Riding Experience\nThe 14-inch pneumatic tires feature a puncture-resistant design for better grip and shock absorption. Combined with a dual suspension system (front fork + rear suspension), the bike provides a stable and comfortable ride on everyday surfaces.\nReliable Lithium Battery for Longer Playtime\nPowered by a 36V 10.4Ah (374.4Wh) lithium-ion battery, the HT100 offers 30–45 km of riding range per charge. With a 5–6 hour charging time, the bike is ready for the next adventure.\nMade for Growing Riders\nRecommended rider height: 130–160 cm · Maximum load: 70 kg. Start at 10 km/h and progress as riding skills develop.",
